  description: '3 Level 5 monsters

    This Xyz Summoned card cannot be destroyed
    by card effects. You can detach 1 material from this card; this card gains ATK
    equal to the total original ATK of all other monsters on the field, then, if
    this card has a DARK Xyz Monster as material, negate the effects of all other
    face-up monsters on the field. After this effect resolves, you cannot declare
    attacks with other monsters for the rest of this turn. You can only use this
    effect of "Arc Rebellion Xyz Dragon" once per turn.'
